{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38919","headline":"题仇处士郊居 · 杜荀鹤","name":"题仇处士郊居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江南景簇此林亭，手板蓝裾自可轻。\n洞里客来无俗话，郭中人到有公情。\n闲敲岩果呼猿接，时钓溪鱼引鹤争。\n笑我有诗三百首，马蹄红日急於名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}